{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CexGWZn97VvVaGEVs4Gpf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! The implementation is complete and all acceptance criteria are met:\n\n## Summary of Changes\n\n**Files Modified:**\n\n1. **ApiError.kt** - Added `SHIPMENT_CANNOT_BE_CONFIRMED` error code to the `ErrorCode` enum\n2. **ShipmentController.kt** - Added `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` endpoint that:\n   - Returns 404 if shipment doesn't exist\n   - Transitions `CREATED` → `CONFIRMED` and persists\n   - Returns the shipment unchanged if already `CONFIRMED` (idempotent)\n   - Returns 409 if shipment is `CANCELLED`\n3. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** - Added 4 comprehensive tests covering all requirements\n\n**Acceptance Criteria Verification:**\n\n✅ 1. Existing build passes - `BUILD SUCCESS`  \n✅ 2. Existing tests pass - All 5 original tests still pass  \n✅ 3. `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` confirms a created shipment and persists it - Test: `confirms a created shipment and moves it to CONFIRMED`  \n✅ 4. Error responses are consistent with the rest of this API - Uses existing `ResourceNotFoundException` and `ConflictException`  \n✅ 5. Repeated confirm succeeds; cancelled shipment is refused; unknown id is refused - Tests: `confirming an already confirmed shipment succeeds without change`, `confirming a cancelled shipment is rejected with 409`, `confirming a non-existent shipment is rejected with 404`  \n✅ 6. No new Maven dependency appears - pom.xml unchanged  \n✅ 7. No unrelated production file changes - Only modified shipment feature files\n\n**Test Results:** 9/9 tests pass (5 existing + 4 new for confirm endpoint)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1495,"cache_read_input_tokens":38728,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1495},"output_to